Language English
Debug Off

Book MythosFirstRitualOpenGate Ordered No Keep
	Triggered By @FirstRitual If goal = goalOpenGate And firstRitual And firstRitual <> firstRitualOver
	
	Page Init
		Text """
			You stop in your tracks as something... happens to the house. You
			aren't sure what it is, but fear clutches your gut as the feeling
			washes over you.
			
			Each investigator takes 1 horror ({will} negates).
		"""

		Exit
	End Page Init
	
	Page Start
		Text """
			The hair on the back of your neck stands up as you feel a power
			filling the space around you. Something dark. Something evil.
			Something violent.
			
			Sarah's eyes widen and she whispers,
			<<Matthias has begun preparations for the ritual, the preparations you
			read about in the {c:QItemDvm}. We must get to the altar before he
			actually opens the gate. We must stop him.>>
			
			No immediate effect.
		"""
		
		firstRitual = 2
		Exit
	End Page Start

	Page Vamp1
		Text """
			Something happens to the air around you as waves of power pass,
			giving you hints about what is creating them. From
			time-to-time, a more powerful wave washes over you. When those 
			waves happen, Sarah's expression turns darker.
			
			Sarah whispers, <<I can feel something happening with a dagger.
			I think Mathias is starting the spell to open a gate.>>
			
			Whatever is happening must be stopped.
			
			No immediate effect.
		"""
		
		firstRitual = firstRitualDagger
		Exit
	End Page Vamp1
	
	Page Vamp2
		No Text
		Goto MythosFirstRitualFeedOrCloseGate.Dagger
	End Page Vamp2
	
	Page Vamp3
		Text """
			The power in the air continues to pulse around you, occasionally
			raising the hair on the back of your neck again.
			
			Sarah looks worried.
			
			No immediate effect.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page Vamp3
	
	Page Vamp4
		No Text
		Goto MythosFirstRitualFeedOrCloseGate.Chalice
	End Page Vamp4
	
	Page Vamp5
		Text """
			With each step Matthias takes toward opening the gate, the air
			around you changes in color and texture, but getting stronger at
			each step. You are feeling the first traces of it in your skin.
			
			Sarah whispers, <<Matthias's blood is spattering in a cup of some
			kind. He is making progress on the spell. We must hurry.>>
			
			No immediate effect.
		"""
		
		firstRitual = firstRitualChalice
		Exit
	End Page Vamp5
	
	Page Vamp6
		No Text
		Goto MythosFirstRitualFeedOrCloseGate.Woman
	End Page Vamp6
	
	Page Vamp7
		Text """
			The woman's screaming abruptly stops and, for a moment, it is silent
			again, as if the house were taking a breath.

			Sarah whispers, <<Matthias has recharged himself. He is nearly at
			the final stage. He is ready to open the gate.>>
			
			No immediate effect.
		"""
		
		firstRitual = firstRitualWoman
		Exit
	End Page Vamp7
	
	Page Vamp8
		Text """
			A boy's terrified scream cuts through the silence. A moment
			later, the most powerful wave yet pummels you. Its evil burns 
			your skin. 
			
			Sarah leans in and whispers, <<He is starting to open the gate. We
			are out of time.>>
			
			No immediate effect.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page Vamp8
	
	Page Fail
		No Text
		fail = true
		Trigger @GameOver
	End Page Fail
End Book MythosFirstRitualOpenGate

Book MythosFirstRitualFeedOrCloseGate Ordered No Keep
	Triggered By @Ritual If (goal = goalFeedGate Or goal = goalCloseGate) And firstRitual And firstRitual <> firstRitualOver

	Page Init
		No Text
		Goto MythosFirstRitualOpenGate.One
	End Page Init
	
	Page Start
		Text """
			From deep in the house, you hear a boy scream in terror. It
			stops abruptly and you feel something change in the air. The floor
			shudders and everything goes quiet for a moment.

			Sarah's eyes widen and she whispers to {c:EventChosenInvestigator},
			<<Matthias has started. The ritual has started. We must find and
			stop him.>>			
		"""
	End Page Start
	
	Page Dagger
		Text """
			You feel something new within the power around you. Something that
			drains you, but somehow makes you feel stronger. You have a sudden
			flash of a knife being dragged across your palms.
			
			Sarah leans in and whispers, <<I can feel him preparing the dagger
			for the ritual. I can see on your face that you sense it too. We
			must find Matthias and stop him.>>
		"""
		
		firstRitual = firstRitualDagger
	End Page Dagger
	
	Page FirstRitualChalice
		Text """
			Another shock hits you, making you feel the knife in your palm
			again. You squeeze your hand into a tight fist but you aren't sure
			why.
			
			Sarah leans in and whispers, <<I can feel him putting his blood in
			a chalice. I can almost see it.>> She looks down at your fist and
			says, <<I can see you are feeling the same thing.>>
		"""
		
		firstRitual = firstRitualChalice
	End Page FirstRitualChalice
	
	Page Woman
		Text """
			The power of Matthias's spell intensifies around you. It draws you in
			and repulses you at the same time. A woman screams. The sound
			pierces the walls, making windows rattle in their
			frames. You feel her take a deep, ragged breath, then she screams
			again. And again. And again.

			She screams like she might never stop.

			Sarah looks at you, eyes wide, and says nothing.

			Each investigator takes 1 Horror ({will} negates).
		"""
	End Page Woman
	
	Page OpenGate
		Text """
			The woman's screaming abruptly stops and, for a moment, it is silent
			again, as if the house were taking a breath. A boy's single,
			terrified scream cuts through the silence. Though cannot see it,
			you feel the gate spring into being. You hear something moan in
			pain; you feel the rumblings of it through the house. You know in
			your gut that it's Matthias's son.

			The power of the gate has infused the air around you with a
			a nearly electric sense of evil, making your skin buzz
			in discomfort.
		"""
		
		firstRitual = firstRitualGateOpen
	End Page Open
	
	Page Stabilize
		Text """
			You can still feel the gate through the walls and floor, sputtering
			and buzzing, making it sound unstable, like it might collapse at
			any moment. 
			
			A cultist runs into the dungeon cell, raises a hand,
			mumbles words, and is sucked through the wall. A moment
			later, the feeling the gate stabilizes.
			
			Sarah leans in, <<I don't think Matthias has an elder sign to 
			stabilize the gate. Maybe that cultist is what he needed to keep
			it open.
		"""
		
		If goal = goalCloseGate Then Text """
			You can still feel the gate through the walls and floor, sputtering
			and buzzing, making it sound unstable, like it might collapse at
			any moment. A cultist runs into the dungeon cell, raises a hand,
			mumbles words, and is sucked through the wall.

			A minute passes and another wave of power washes over you. When it
			passes, you can still feel the gate, but it is stable, powerful,
			and quiet.
			
			Sarah leans in, <<He used an elder sign to stabilize the gate. Now
			he will start summoning.>>
		"""
		
		If goal = goalCloseGate Then firstRitual = firstRitualGateStabilized
	End Page Stabilize
	
	Page Summon
		Text """
			Power is now pulsing through the house and caves. Sarah is visibly
			upset and is no longer whispering. She says loudly, <<Matthias is
			summoning his god, an Ancient One.>>
		"""
	End Page Summon
	
	Page SummonContinue
		Text """
			Something rumbles up from beneath you. You can feel its power, its
			need. You know it is what Matthias is summoning.
			
			Panicked, Sarah bellows so everyone can here her, <<We are running
			out of time. You must complete your tasks so I can help you. Until
			then, we don't know what to do, where to do it, or with what tools.
			Hurry.>>
		"""
	End Page
	
	Page
		Text """
			The gate continues to hum while bursts of energy come from beneath
			and course through you.
			
			Sarah yells, <<I can feel it---the Ancient One. It is nearly here.
			We are out of time.>>
		"""
	End Page
	
	Page Fail
		Text """
			Something in the air changes. Something evil. Something final.
			
			The investigation is over.
		"""
		
		fail = true
		Trigger @GameOver
	End Page Fail
End Book MythosFirstRitualFeedOrCloseGate

